OL,3,GNEWSALincolnshire's Christmas lights
OL,4,Aevents 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FTown centre lights switch-ons, markets
OL,7,Fand festive events will soon kick off
OL,8,Facross Lincolnshire.
OL,10,FLincoln's light switch-on will take
OL,11,Fplace on Thursday 26 November, with the
OL,12,Fevent starting at 16:30 GMT and the
OL,13,Flights being switched on at 18:50.
OL,15,FFrom North Lincolnshire to South
OL,16,FHolland, a whole host of Christmas
OL,17,Fevents will be taking place across the
OL,18,Fcounty.
OL,20,FIf you are looking to get into the
OL,21,Ffestive spirit, here's a selection of
OL,22,Fsome of the events taking place:
